The Tantric Text Atlas — focused research expansion
The strongest direction is to build a specialized archive of the highest-level Indian and Tibetan contemplative literature, rather than a general spiritual audiobook collection.

I'd organize it into five interconnected traditions:

Trika, Pratyabhijñā, Spanda and Krama — recognition, consciousness, vibration, freedom and the Goddess.

Kaula and Śākta Tantra — Kubjikā, Kālī, Tripurasundarī, Śrīvidyā, mantra, ritual and the subtle body.

